Modified components and purpose: scene extraction, configuration, hardware/logging
helpers, and integration were adapted into a local, human-reviewed visual-note
editor with timestamped PNG, PDF and OCR exports. Audio transcription, local LLM
synthesis and Qwen-based analysis from the original direction are not included.
New editor, crop/trim workflow, adaptive sampler, review/detail controls, diagnostic
recorder and export orchestration were developed for TransVision.

